{"synopsis":"Sepuluh ribu ras menginvasi, Semua orang mendapatkan kemampuan spesial, dan era super terlahir! Di era ini, semuanya bergabung dengan militer untuk menghadapi ras alien dan mempertahankan hak ras mereka. Nan Ziying, seorang pemuda berumur 20 tahun, memilih berada dibarisan belakang saat rekrutmen dan menjadi prajurit logistic. Banyak prajurit yang khawatir, para pemuda membencinya, dan para lelaki tua berambut putih dibiarkan membawa senjata. Hanya dia dan sekelompok perempuan, anak-anak, dan remaja yang tersisa. Kemudian, Nan Ziying membangkitkan lima talenta hebat, merencanakan secara diam-diam, dan di era supremasi Sepuluh Ribu Ras ini, dia berkata, “Akulah malapetaka dari Sepuluh Ribu Ras ini!”","alternative_title":"万族入侵：全民参战，我留守后方, Wan Zu Ru Qin: Quanmin Canzhan, Wo Liushou Houfang, Invasion of All Races: All the People Join the War, I Stay Behind, 我屠尽万族！","author":"城下的妖","artist":"春日文化","chapters":[{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"b26a5ca9-f06a-48ee-ae45-c422b411af4d","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"8e644999-3626-4deb-9321-fc6d6bbc1704","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-03-15"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"35e28259-7e35-4ec7-b437-221f8d19b997","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-03-15"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"4462c736-9cbc-4ab8-a6f2-e1d7edf771bf","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-02-24"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"f765e19d-0763-42cd-b589-0886baef8468","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-01-15"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"f075052f-f331-4cde-ad3f-3f5ae9d5859b","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2025-12-30"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"41b9aa33-3464-42d9-b0c9-6d7acc2f6769","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2025-12-30"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"922dcea5-6624-4413-ab42-7e51c9cdd232","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2025-10-24"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"df096167-6e5b-4fac-aaf0-8f30961d2096","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2025-10-23"},{"numbe